ys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.16, "end": 1151.16, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.16, "end": 1153.16, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.16, "end": 1156.16, "text": "- Enough with the timeline, crap, Ovid."}, {"start": 1156.16, "end": 1158.76, "text": "Pierce got shut in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1158.76, "end": 1160.16, "text": "Surely he's a drunk."}, {"start": 1160.16, "end": 1161.66, "text": "And he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.66, "end": 1163.76, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1163.76, "end": 1166.06, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.06, "end": 1167.96, "text": "Troy lost his larynx"}, {"start": 1167.96, "end": 1169.46, "text": "because for some dumb reason"}, {"start": 1169.46, "end": 1172.76, "text": "he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.76, "end": 1175.76, "text": "(mumbling)"}, {"start": 1175.76, "end": 1178.76, "text": "Life has gone to hell, Abed."}, {"start": 1178.76, "end": 1180.06, "text": "This is real."}, {"start": 1180.06, "end": 1180.86, "text": "Look at us."}, {"start": 1180.86, "end": 1181.76, "text": "Look at me."}, {"start": 1181.76, "end": 1184.86, "text": "- Greta, you put one wash away blue streak in your hair"}, {"start": 1184.86, "end": 1186.7, "text": "And I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1186.7, "end": 1188.9, "text": "Exactly. Life got dark."}, {"start": 1188.9, "end": 1190.2, "text": "Well, because Jeff are all the one."}, {"start": 1190.2, "end": 1192.4, "text": "Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.4, "end": 1193.3, "text": "It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.3, "end": 1194.9, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my head,"}, {"start": 1194.9, "end": 1196.3, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.3, "end": 1198.84, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1198.84, "end": 1201.0, "text": "I failed to do that, and we all suffered for it."}, {"start": 1201.0, "end": 1202.5, "text": "But I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1204.84, "end": 1205.64, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.64, "end": 1207.48, "text": "Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.48, "end": 1209.48, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.48, "end": 1210.98, "text": "I made us all black motifs out of felt."}, {"start": 1210.98, "end": 1212.98, "text": "I suggest you put 'em on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1214.86, "end": 1216.86, "text": "From now on, I'm evil, Abed."}, {"start": 1216.86, "end": 1219.86, "text": "We are the evil study group, and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1219.86, "end": 1221.86, "text": "Return to somehow to the prime timeline."}, {"start": 1221.86, "end": 1223.86, "text": "The one that I stopped you from rolling that dive."}, {"start": 1223.86, "end": 1225.86, "text": "Then we destroy the good versions of ourselves,"}, {"start": 1225.86, "end": 1227.86, "text": "and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1227.86, "end": 1229.86, "text": "Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1229.86, "end": 1232.86, "text": "As evil Jeff, am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.86, "end": 1234.86, "text": "Certainly. I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.86, "end": 1236.86, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.86, "end": 1240.86, "text": "I lost my damn arm, and you're making fake birds!"}, {"start": 1240.86, "end": 1242.86, "text": "Go, tease."}, {"start": 1242.86, "end": 1245.1, "text": "(grunting)"}, {"start": 1253.34, "end": 1255.7, "text": "Evil, Troy and Evil, aaaah, bad!"}, {"start": 1255.7, "end": 1257.7, "text": "(gunshots)"}, {"start": 1257.7, "end": 1259.1, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1259.1, "end": 1261.6, "text": "(groaning)"}, {"start": 1261.6, "end": 1263.42, "text": "- Oh, hold on, let me pop this, kids."}, {"start": 1263.42, "end": 1264.26, "text": "- What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1264.26, "end": 1265.1, "text": "- Just in time."}, {"start": 1265.1, "end": 1265.94, "text": "- More accurately."}, {"start": 1265.94, "end": 1266.78, "text": "- I don't know."}, {"start": 1266.78, "end": 1268.78, "text": "- We got out of just in space."}, {"start": 1268.78, "end": 1270.38, "text": "We'll pull by, certainly, what, right,"}, {"start": 1270.38, "end": 1272.38, "text": "I guess nothin'."}]}